  "description": "Ready to play more pickleball? PlayTime Scheduler makes it easier than ever to organize games, connect with more players, and hit the courts with a plan! Some key features of our platform include:\n\nΓÇó Accurate Play Calendars: View real sessions posted by local playersΓÇöno outdated or auto-generated listings.\nΓÇó Easy Sign-Up: Join sessions that match your format and skill level with just one tapΓÇöno group codes required.\nΓÇó Custom Notifications: Get instant alerts for new games, session changes, player messages, and more.\nΓÇó Player Communication: Stay connected with session notes, private and group chats.\nΓÇó Community Features: Post and browse local questions, photos, videos, announcements, surveys, and self-serve ads.\nΓÇó Court Maps & Directories: Discover new court locations, vetted and maintained by local admins.\nΓÇó Cross-Device Compatibility: Seamlessly switch between your desktop, smartphone, and tablet.\n\nRegistration is fast, free, and easy. Log in to your home region and explore a weekly calendar with pickleball sessions posted by other local players. Sessions are labeled by time, location, skill level, gender, and format. If you would like to join one, just tap the \"Add My Name\" button. You can also add notes that other players can read and respond to, and exchange group or private messages.\n\nCanΓÇÖt find a session that works for you? Post your own in just seconds and connect with players instantly! Just tap the \"Add Session\" button and fill in the form. Matching players in your region will be notified and have the opportunity to sign up. You'll get a notification when your session reaches the minimum number of players, so you know it's \"game on!\"\n\nChoose from three levels of access: Free, Premium, and Power User. Premium unlocks a popup ad-free app experience and calendar customization features, while Power User adds a rich suite of advanced scheduling features.\n\nThis mobile app improves on the web experience with the following new features:\n\nΓÇó Face ID/Touch ID login\nΓÇó Instant push notifications\nΓÇó Larger fonts and buttons for easier navigation\nΓÇó Pop-up ad-free experience (Premium/Power Users only)\nΓÇó Registration and play reminders (Power Users only)\n\nPlayTime Scheduler - Where Pickleball Lives! Join the community today and take your pickleball experience to the next level!\n\nTerms of use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.playtimescheduler.com/privacy.php",
